        'markdown' => 'Meeting was held with the Honorable Minister of State for Revenue, Mr. Muhammad Hammad Azhar with APMIA representatives including Chairman Mian Gulzar Ahmed, Senior Vice Chairman Muhammad Bilal Khan, Sub Zonal Vice Chairman Shabbir Ahmed and Shakir Ullah, Muhammad Sabir Khan, Imran Khan, Malik Faisal, Taimoor Khan and Himit Shah regarding draft SRO 1226(I)/2018, following conclusions were made in the said meeting;

